  "rewrites": {
   "1": {
    "original": "In June, SpaceX landed at another historic first, winning a contract by the American Civilian Services Administration -- the public services component of the government's \"go to\" government solutions -- as its official Civilian Launch Provider, again beating both Orbital ATK and Boeing to the prize.",
    "rewrite": "In June, SpaceX secured another historic first by winning a contract through the American Civilian Services Administration -- the public services arm of the government's \"go to\" government solutions -- as the official Civilian Launch Provider, once again outpacing both Orbital ATK and Boeing in the competition."
   },
   "2": {
